{"cards.28.card.light_astro.headline.direct_to_dog": "Your Pluto Can Read the Fine Print Before Mars Plays Again", "cards.28.card.light_astro.headline.handler": "Pluto Makes Mars Stop for the Fine Print", "cards.34.card.no_astro.headline.hybrid": "From Clue to Cue", "cards.40.card.light_astro.body.direct_to_dog": "Your Mercury notices the fine print: scent, tone, footsteps, sequence. With the North Node beside it, that noticing can become a social skill. You can inspect the world and still return to the group. Let one gentle cue be your bridge from private investigation to a choice made with us.", "cards.7.card.no_astro.body.direct_to_dog": "Ella, you pick up the fine print of a room. When your person gives that noticing a clear next move, you can show just how beautifully your attention works.", "cards.7.card.no_astro.headline.hybrid": "From Clue to Cue"}

